    /// the no-progress budget, and a content-runaway by the child's own
    /// <c>maxRecoveryWork</c> / <c>shouldKeepRecovering</c>. Set a finite value to impose a
    /// wall-clock cap (which also tears the child down on <c>window-exceeded</c>).
    /// </summary>
    abstract agentToolReattachMaxWindowMs: float with get, set
