    /// <c>onFinish</c> callbacks) in an appropriate execution context. The base <c>Agent</c>
    /// has no turn queue, so it only establishes <c>agentContext</c> — a handler that
    /// calls <c>runAgentTool</c> / <c>setState</c> therefore works regardless of where the
    /// delivery fired from.
    /// <br /><br />
