    /// this to additionally serialize delivery against their turn queue when
    /// <c>serialize</c> is set: a fast-path push or backbone tick can land mid-turn, and
    /// a state-mutating <c>onFinish</c> running concurrently with an active LLM turn is a
    /// data race. The fast path and backbone never run synchronously inside a turn
    /// (they fire from <c>waitUntil</c> / a scheduled alarm), so enqueuing them on the
    /// turn queue is deadlock-free. An explicit <c>cancelAgentTool</c> runs with
