        /// <br /><br />
        /// Default for <c>McpAgent</c>. Override <c>McpAgent.getEventStore()</c> to swap
        /// or disable.
        /// <br /><br />
        /// ## Storage layout
        /// <br /><br />
        /// Events are stored under <c>__mcp_event__:&lt;streamId&gt;:&lt;seqHex&gt;</c>, where
        /// <c>&lt;seqHex&gt;</c> is a 16-char zero-padded counter so events in a stream
        /// sort lexicographically and <c>getStreamIdForEventId</c> can recover the
        /// stream from <c>eventId</c> without a storage hit.
        /// <br /><br />
        /// ## Lifecycle
        /// <br /><br />
