        /// <c>&lt;seqHex&gt;</c> is a 16-char zero-padded counter so events in a stream
        /// sort lexicographically and <c>getStreamIdForEventId</c> can recover the
        /// stream from <c>eventId</c> without a storage hit.
        /// <br /><br />
        /// ## Lifecycle
        /// <br /><br />
